{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261124/photo/bkn-20261124000110773-1124_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261124001658\"/><p>涉事兩輛私家車，其中一輛翻側。</p><p>葵涌發生交通意外。昨日(23日)晚上10時28分，一輛白色私家車與一輛深色私家車駛至葵涌道與葵益道交界發生碰撞。意外後，深色私家車翻側停於行人輔助線，司機自行爬出車外待援，兩車車頭均損毀。</p><p>救援人員到場發現兩名傷者，幸傷勢並不算嚴重，乘救護車送院救治。警員正調查意外起因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T16:38:02.097102+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T16:01:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T18:12:25.921289+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T16:31:29.618743+00:00","content_hash":"54cd48f174a5e7992ad1ea3ee752612deeb82c2d198799cdf7a2e4dc95a9b9c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}